DVhKU7iEh1U.content:
Looking for a flower CSA? Three farms at ASAP's CSA Fair next Thursday (March 12, 3:30-6, at @ywcaofavl) have you covered! Talk to these farms about adding a little more beauty and fragrance to your life!

@blazingstarflowers' 16-week CSA offers pre-made mixed bouquets or loose stems for DIY home arrangements by the week or month. Brighten up your home or workspace with gorgeous, fresh, seasonal, and sustainably grown flowers! There's also a one-time flower seedling pickup in May. CSA Members are invited to the farm for an open house during the growing season to say hello and see where their flowers come from.

Signing up for @carolinaflowrs' year-round flower subscription means that you’re investing in the flowers they are tending on their flower farm—and getting the best possible price! Customize your subscription for pay-as-you-go monthly or weekly flowers.

@sunseekerflowers may have the brightness you are seeking. Enjoy farm-fresh flowers picked at their very best. They offer flexible pick-up with multiple locations, so it’s easy to add flowers to your weekday errands. Every bouquet is harvested just for you, cut and conditioned early in the week for peak freshness.

Find more information about the fair, CSA farms across the region, and the value of CSAs at asapconnections.org/csa.

DVt0fXEku6k.content:
Meet more produce farmers attending ASAP's CSA Fair on March 12, 3:30-6 p.m. at the @ywcaofavl! 

@wildeastfarm's veggie box subscriptions are fully customizable with the option to add farm-raised eggs and/or chicken. Each weekly box contains 5-7 different seasonal vegetables, which you have the option to customize each week based on what’s available in the garden. All Wild East's foods are raised using 100% organic methods and with no-till practices.

@olivettefarm offers two different CSA types—market and traditional. With a focus on flavor, freshness, colors and quality, they grow over 40 different types of vegetables. The Traditional Box Share is 20 weeks and great for small families, individuals and couples who cook the majority of their meals. The Market Share option gives you all the freedom to choose variety and time of pick up for the duration of the growing season. You receive a pre-paid farm card with a credit amount of your choosing that allows you to shop at their farm stand and markets they attend.

Find details about the fair, CSA farms, and more at asapconnections.org/csa.

